{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_ex01","title":"聲東擊西","storyCode":"RI-EX-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"c02c06f37a4e266d394b7cdb0ad4982b57e5a8eb8ffee277f76b7fd68c77a0f1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"烈日，荒野，黃沙，熱風！wohoo！新的歌曲在我的心中誕生了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個太吵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。難得有這麼空曠又無人的環境，不用擔心被追趕的事，就不能安靜地休息一會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，Alty，這裡也能聞到海的氣息，真的安全嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Aya，你真是一如既往的不解風情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上沒有安全的地方，但我們總要學會給自己放鬆一下，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"或許你是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"所以下一步，我們要用什麼拓寬前進的道路？總不能再空手而歸了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，這次那個醫生已經給了我們答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Alty看了看手中的“鑰匙”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎真的嗎？這個東西看上去可不普通，她居然願意把這個東西給你？你拿啥換的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"知識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"知識與這東西是等價的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不清楚，不過我覺得醫生她是在催促我們去運用這個知識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"她會不知道這些嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我們知道多少，她應該就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"......仔細想想，真正的交易內容，應該是用我們的好奇心換來了我們的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"這，她不是啥都沒出嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"被騙了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該說是被誘導了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"被指揮了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"被指引了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"當真有這麼重要嗎，這個醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不重要。我覺得這個醫生正是想告訴我們，她的舉動並不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是我們怎麼想，怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那鑰匙呢？我們要去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，很麻煩。能不能不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我想這就和音樂一樣......我們不應該擁有一種可以強制改變別人的力量，我們只是唱自己的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"唱給他們聽，如果好聽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們也會唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那就把更多的知識和鑰匙都交給準備好了的人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"會是誰呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"還不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定還沒出生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了，但願他還沒出生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"別期待這種事情，Dan，我們......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，Alty。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"車沒能量了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有準備嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"準備了，但我們之前繞路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我必須承認，在這種沒有公路也沒有路標的荒野上行駛，很容易喪失方向感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，我們迷路了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不能完全這麼說，在大方向上，我們並沒有偏離，只能說我們在開闢新的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"迷路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"迷路！這也是個不錯的題材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不說，Dan，我有時候真想學學你的樂觀。那怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那個方向好像有一片雨林，我們去那邊看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那，誰來推車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們可以輪流來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我們周邊已經聚集了不少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們聽不懂他們的語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"所以就這樣讓他們跟著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你有更好的方法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"把他們全都解決掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能說服Frost和Dan的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（彈唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"&*......%￥......&（這、這是什麼聲音，為什麼會這麼好聽？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"&%......%（我從沒聽過這樣的聲音......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，你們好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說的是什麼語言啊，可以告訴我嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，雖然你們說了我也不會知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"......%&￥（這些人是哪裡來的？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人D","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"￥......&#（這傢伙怎麼長得這麼奇怪？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，至少這裡有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這裡有能讓我們補給的地方就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為你在做夢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是外鄉人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你說的是薩爾貢語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看來你們確實是外鄉人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你們為什麼來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的車耗盡了能量，所以一路來到這裡想要找一些懂源石技藝的人幫我們補充一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，Aya，這不是出現了希望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，這片大地真是無奇不有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂，喂喂喂喂喂，怎麼回事，怎麼回事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"在這樣一片原始的雨林裡，竟然有這樣一座村莊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"確實令人吃驚，大部分的建築都有現代建築的影子，但也保留了原始的美感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"很古怪，但也很獨特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我是這個部族的族長，祖瑪瑪，我的部族的人大部分都能聽懂你們說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以安排一些部族祭司給你們的交通工具補充能量，但是我有條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼樣的條件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我想看一看你們的車的內部構造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"......就這樣就可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定你不會把我們的車搞壞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"應該不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我們並沒有多少選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我們同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"好。大祭司爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到在這裡能遇到你這樣的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，不瞞你們說，我也是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"不過比起你們，我還是對你們的車更加好奇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我要重複一下剛才的話，這片大地真是無奇不有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我難得同意你的意見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這時，frost把吉他接上了祭祀用的音響，開始了一段即興獨奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯啊，Frost。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"這座奇特的村莊給了我靈感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好帥啊，Frost，這次的旋律還加入了一些變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"熾熱，壓抑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我把這段曲子，取名為......《D》！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡來的聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼聲音？我感覺我渾身都充滿了力量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像是剛才來的外鄉人！快去看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"人越來越多了，Alty......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不妙哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"這些生命在渴望音樂！渴望力量！渴望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個聲音是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外鄉人啊，請留下更多的聲音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty......雖然很突然，不過我覺得現在的氛圍也很適合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"乾脆把我們的音響搬出來，一起上去演奏一曲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"總之我不反對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊好啊，可不能讓Frost一個人搶了風頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼勁爆的編曲，我不參一腳怎麼行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓這裡的人感受我們的AUS的音樂吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼只是一些聲音，我卻興奮得停不下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這難道和祭司們用的祭樂一樣，是所謂的“樂曲”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒聽過這樣的樂曲！她們究竟是什麼人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人D","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，她們一定是“奎卡亞提”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"“奎卡亞提”？這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，這是他們的語言中對“唱歌的人”的稱呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經很久沒有出現過“奎卡亞提”了，你們的音樂征服了她們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不得不說，你們的音樂和我過去聽過的奎卡亞提的音樂完全不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"但是沒有關係，我覺得你們的音樂更加有趣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“奎卡亞提”，再給我們演奏一曲吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人F","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們想要什麼都可以，再來一曲吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，Alty？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"留下來吧，Alty！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我想提醒你們不要忘記我們的目標......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，好吧，我們有的是時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到這裡還有信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒想到只在雜誌上見過的AUS竟然會來到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"她在製造你們想要的音響，所以由我來給你帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你們打算在這裡待多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是一周，也許是一個月，也許是一年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡點燃了我們，那我們至少要在這裡盡興才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼這裡應該更加適合你們演出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好酷的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......某種神廟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，這裡過去是所有部族聚集在一起舉辦“瑪維索提亞”的地方，不過自從嘉維爾離開後，已經很久沒有用過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"“瑪維索提亞”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾？我好像在羅德島上看過這個名字......算了，應該只是同名吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可以在這裡進行你們的演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"讓這裡的人享受最好的音樂吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒錯，在這裡留下屬於AUS的痕跡吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩個月後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUS真是一些不可思議的傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然就真的在這裡停留了兩個月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這下嘉維爾要是哪天回來的話恐怕會大吃一驚吧，這樣一個偏僻的地方，竟然也出現了音樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的人竟然愛上了搖滾樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，今天她們又打算帶來什麼樣的演出呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......說不定最狂熱的是我自己也說不定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUS的各位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"房間是空的，各種生活用品和被褥也都擺放整齊，中央的簡易桌子上，放著一張紙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"難道她們離開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"桌上的這封信，我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"“我們走了，勿念。願音樂能帶給你們歡樂。還有，我們把我們的唱片全都留在了這裡，盡情享受吧。——AUS”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，真是一群不可思議的傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我不會忘記這個叫做阿卡胡拉的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼唱）一次難忘的經歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這裡的人還是太吵了，而且太野蠻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？我很喜歡啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然喜歡，我覺得把你留在那裡你也不會反對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實猶豫了很久誒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不覺得這裡的人擁有一種天然的、原始的活力嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經去過很多國家很多城市了，但是沒有一個地方的人是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜歡他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，這一點我確實無法否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"他們理解了我們的音樂，他們是最棒的聽眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"看來Frost也很中意他們呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"可不該把別人的生活攪得天翻地覆。只要唱歌就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"唱給他們聽，如果好聽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們也會唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是說過一樣的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道呢，我們或許說過無數次同樣的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們該繼續我們的旅途了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"把歌聲唱給這片大地，他會傾聽嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾個人在車上，開了個玩笑就結束了。\nAlty看著手中的鑰匙，凱爾希醫生啊，你們羅德島能給這片大地想要的答案嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
